# Contact form email delivery (Resend)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Create a free account at https://resend.com
# 2. Go to https://resend.com/api-keys and create a key with "Sending access"
# 3. Paste it below
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here

# Where contact form submissions get sent. Defaults to navajkerrie@gmail.com
# (the value in src/data/site.ts) if you leave this unset.
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=navajkerrie@gmail.com

# Who the email appears to come from. The default below (onboarding@resend.dev)
# works immediately with zero setup, but Resend only allows it to deliver to
# the email address you signed up to Resend with — fine for testing the form
# yourself, not for real visitors.
#
# To receive messages from real visitors, verify a domain you own at
# https://resend.com/domains (takes a few DNS records, ~15 minutes), then
# point this at an address on that domain, e.g.:
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=Javan Portfolio <hello@javansportfolio.net>
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=Javan Portfolio <onboarding@resend.dev>
